# Pass "avec-pickletools": stages InterfaceScale and ScreenshotMode beside the mod, so scenario 16's
# 150% click lands on the Workshop Pickle and the review captures have no HUD over their text.
#
#   scripts/Run-PickleWsl.ps1 -Mod ArchitectStudio -DepMap wsl-deps.avec-pickletools.map -Filter '16-language-review.feature'
#
# The repair is a Harmony postfix on TagStore.Record, applied to every click of the run.
# `16-language-review.feature` calls the maintained PickleTools scale step directly, so the
# scale setup and the click-coordinate repair come from the same development-only companion.
#
# `path:` names a folder of the PickleTools repository (relative to the collection's root); the folder's own
# About.xml packageId must match. See PickleTools/InterfaceScale/README.md - in particular the "delete this"
# list for when RimWorks/Rimworld-Pickle pull request 23 merges.
nelim.pickletools.interfacescale   path:PickleTools/InterfaceScale/Mod
nelim.pickletools.screenshotmode   path:PickleTools/ScreenshotMode/Mod
